#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:52
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Mailing Lists"
msgstr "邮件列表"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Mailing lists are the primary communication channel for the FreeBSD "
"community, covering a wide range of topics related to the project.  Messages "
"are typically written in plain text without graphical elements, making them "
"well-suited for use with screen readers (both Braille displays and speech "
"synthesizers).  A complete list of available mailing lists can be found at: "
"https://lists.freebsd.org/."
msgstr "邮件列表是 FreeBSD 社区的主要交流渠道，涵盖与项目相关的各种主题。消息通常以纯文本形式编写，不含图形元素，因此非常适合使用屏幕阅读器（盲文显示器和语音合成器）阅读。完整的邮件列表清单请参阅 link:https://lists.freebsd.org/[]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For accessibility issues, the main point of contact is the FreeBSD "
"Accessibility Mailing List.  To subscribe, browse the archive, send "
"messages, or manage your subscription, visit: https://lists.freebsd.org/"
"subscription/freebsd-accessibility"
msgstr "对于无障碍访问问题，主要联系渠道是 FreeBSD 无障碍访问邮件列表。要订阅、浏览存档、发送消息或管理订阅，请访问 link:https://lists.freebsd.org/subscription/freebsd-accessibility[]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:62
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Chat"
msgstr "聊天"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:67
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD users and developers are also active on IRC (Internet Relay Chat), "
"where real-time communication takes place.  A complete list of servers and "
"channels is available at: https://wiki.freebsd.org/IRC/Channels Messages are "
"typically exchanged in plain text, making IRC well-suited for screen readers "
"(both Braille displays and speech synthesizers)."
msgstr "FreeBSD 用户和开发者也活跃于 IRC（互联网中继聊天），在这里可以进行实时交流。完整的服务器和频道列表请参阅 link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/IRC/Channels[]。消息通常以纯文本形式交流，因此 IRC 非常适合使用屏幕阅读器（盲文显示器和语音合成器）的用户。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:69
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Ports and Packages"
msgstr "Ports 和软件包"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the issue pertains to an external tool installed through a extref:"
"{handbook}ports[port or package], consider including the port maintainer in "
"the discussion to ensure proper attention and resolution."
msgstr "如果问题涉及通过 extref:{handbook}ports[port 或软件包] 安装的外部工具，可以考虑在讨论中联系该 port 的维护者，以确保问题得到妥善关注和解决。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:75
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To find out who maintains a specific port, navigate to the port's directory "
"and run the command `make maintainer`.  For example, to find the maintainer "
"of the package:www/edbrowse[] port, run:"
msgstr "要查找特定 port 的维护者，请进入该 port 的目录并运行命令 `make maintainer`。例如，要查找 package:www/edbrowse[] port 的维护者，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:80
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% cd /usr/ports/www/edbrowse\n"
"% make maintainer\n"
msgstr "% cd /usr/ports/www/edbrowse\n% make maintainer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:84
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To find the maintainer of an installed package, use the `pkg info -f "
"_package_`.  For example:"
msgstr "要查找已安装软件包的维护者，请使用 `pkg info -f _package_`。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/help/_index.adoc:88
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% pkg info -f edbrowse | grep Maintainer | awk '{print $3}'\n"
msgstr "% pkg info -f edbrowse | grep Maintainer | awk '{print $3}'\n"
